window.EXAUD={"'Kind' is an adjective that describes people.": "audio/cau/e79678700752e8de.mp3", "Find one adjective in this sentence: Lan is clever.": "audio/cau/543a075275273447.mp3", "Kind and friendly are adjectives.": "audio/cau/571da65dd4451319.mp3", "Find two adjectives in each sentence.": "audio/cau/e83a6ada9ad972af.mp3", "Can you say that again, please?": "audio/cau/7e3810543bbdcfd8.mp3", "Mi read the story again and again.": "audio/cau/1afa85aeab810227.mp3", "I am a student at Kim Dong School.": "audio/cau/7c9effe742362b92.mp3", "I am in Class 6A, and my friends are in 6B.": "audio/cau/69bce6abc68e1822.mp3", "Mi and Nam are in Class 6A.": "audio/cau/b0d165e52ca7dc85.mp3", "We are happy today, and Lan is happy too.": "audio/cau/9718e7702bade08e.mp3", "Who is the author of this book?": "audio/cau/307f149b72d48019.mp3", "To Hoai is a famous author.": "audio/cau/e04eb4b941758460.mp3", "Look at picture b and answer.": "audio/cau/b2672a8a1898ddda.mp3", "Write the letter b next to the right answer.": "audio/cau/9ec7b58bf879e0bc.mp3", "Eating too much sugar is bad for your teeth.": "audio/cau/385b55508b3849c3.mp3", "The traffic was bad today, but yesterday it was worse.": "audio/cau/4db5861a9ee30736.mp3", "The city was badly affected by the flood.": "audio/cau/1e256308778b183a.mp3", "Nam played badly today, but yesterday he played worse.": "audio/cau/c2078c45e0d95aa8.mp3", "Please be quiet in the library.": "audio/cau/d6fab02a2655be4e.mp3", "I want to be a doctor. My sister is a nurse.": "audio/cau/e31166f3ca032296.mp3", "It's sunny. Let's go to the beach.": "audio/cau/270a764075ddb193.mp3", "My Khe Beach in Da Nang is very beautiful.": "audio/cau/c42618aa030cc85a.mp3", "Hoi An is a beautiful old town.": "audio/cau/e98bb193dd75aa2b.mp3", "Lan sings beautifully, and her voice is beautiful.": "audio/cau/4d5c5951771c97b1.mp3", "She sings beautifully.": "audio/cau/d5196d517491e1f4.mp3", "The room is beautifully decorated.": "audio/cau/379b1e778bdefbb9.mp3", "We love the beauty of the countryside.": "audio/cau/b293e5559d039844.mp3", "Ha Long Bay is famous for its beauty; it is really beautiful.": "audio/cau/59dc842a0cb367f8.mp3", "Our school has a big garden.": "audio/cau/6b86817f41024790.mp3", "My house is big, but Minh's house is bigger.": "audio/cau/1d7d2b8d19284673.mp3", "Ho Chi Minh City is bigger than Da Nang.": "audio/cau/5efe9fe286047142.mp3", "My house is big, but Nam's house is bigger.": "audio/cau/44f8b6366001f6da.mp3", "This is the biggest market in the city.": "audio/cau/ba6358ef44b7b295.mp3", "Ho Chi Minh City is the biggest city in Viet Nam.": "audio/cau/815c69dda42327e1.mp3", "Long speeches bore me.": "audio/cau/8caeb0926b488ee3.mp3", "I don't want to bore you with details.": "audio/cau/0053023504c797f2.mp3", "I'm bored. Let's go out.": "audio/cau/349dce422beb0ca4.mp3", "She gets bored with the same games.": "audio/cau/5538b000e1d9a2cc.mp3", "Reading helps me fight boredom.": "audio/cau/50e83619a7ea3b82.mp3", "He played games out of boredom.": "audio/cau/d68f7ca31f034697.mp3", "The film was long and boring.": "audio/cau/2fb37c98bad76a4f.mp3", "The lesson was boring, so Nam felt bored.": "audio/cau/0b9b11807d964d8b.mp3", "We play games at break time.": "audio/cau/d7be6e5b8ac32945.mp3", "Be careful not to break the cup; Nam broke one yesterday.": "audio/cau/cb188b00dfe78e80.mp3", "My bike is broken.": "audio/cau/b25995551405e15b.mp3", "Be careful with the broken glass.": "audio/cau/67b6f7828c3ee823.mp3", "Everyone is busily preparing for Tet.": "audio/cau/1c1351fcc2fbcb4d.mp3", "She was busily writing.": "audio/cau/8e4c80c34f09a8b6.mp3", "Her family runs a small business in Hue.": "audio/cau/5535eee598660a8f.mp3", "He started a business and now he is a businessman.": "audio/cau/0fd271a26ee50825.mp3", "My uncle is a successful businessman.": "audio/cau/f0ac2a2960c3b45f.mp3", "Many businessmen and businesswomen came to the meeting.": "audio/cau/843f693ed8691d3e.mp3", "My aunt is a successful businesswoman.": "audio/cau/969a25840998f6db.mp3", "The businesswoman travels a lot.": "audio/cau/72e3e47ef97bff41.mp3", "I love the bustle of the city.": "audio/cau/553001dd7b5e719d.mp3", "The village is far from the hustle and bustle.": "audio/cau/12345267b7ca6d66.mp3", "Ho Chi Minh City is a bustling city.": "audio/cau/3597bb53664f0dd1.mp3", "The market is bustling, but my street is quiet.": "audio/cau/f2c456603c67155d.mp3", "My mum is always busy at weekends.": "audio/cau/e860f8923617b0aa.mp3", "Hoa is busy today, but she is free tomorrow.": "audio/cau/1d5a0a62fb11072c.mp3", "The correct answer is c.": "audio/cau/115cc222c2d7fb6e.mp3", "Look at picture c and describe the girl.": "audio/cau/a211a53ea5c1cc24.mp3", "My village is calm and green.": "audio/cau/bc7c091bd908318d.mp3", "The streets are calm and quiet at night.": "audio/cau/2a74b9e92030e5a3.mp3", "Mi can swim very well.": "audio/cau/3e8edac082144330.mp3", "I can ride a bike now, but last year I couldn't.": "audio/cau/af33705bbc26781d.mp3", "My grandmother is kind and caring.": "audio/cau/a03423bedfa41d41.mp3", "Hoa is caring. She takes care of her little sister.": "audio/cau/7cc44adf2286a858.mp3", "I often chat with my neighbours.": "audio/cau/f9bdc10e4250f241.mp3", "Mi and Lan had a long chat after school.": "audio/cau/92771962baaa6db3.mp3", "My sister is very chatty.": "audio/cau/276b5f54d77e4429.mp3", "The chatty boy has many friends.": "audio/cau/40b44064047e81db.mp3", "I help my mum with the chores.": "audio/cau/ec58d4ed18c9c760.mp3", "Doing chores is my duty at weekends.": "audio/cau/09249f9d1a1fd9c1.mp3", "Big cities often have traffic jams.": "audio/cau/290573a9de9b8727.mp3", "Ha Noi is a city, and Hue is a city too.": "audio/cau/723b5f4c4ced8460.mp3", "Every citizen should obey the law.": "audio/cau/ea7f4c7f2b1f7427.mp3", "He is a Vietnamese citizen.": "audio/cau/e80d176ec8a69643.mp3", "I live in a big city.": "audio/cau/66e0022bec290560.mp3", "Life in the city is busier than in the countryside.": "audio/cau/ec0678a3bad99639.mp3", "Thanks to garbage collectors, our streets are clean.": "audio/cau/daef4e3fa0819a5e.mp3", "We clean the streets every weekend.": "audio/cau/d0801c735785b87e.mp3", "The cleaner works early in the morning.": "audio/cau/2d62413dec6c90b6.mp3", "The street cleaner cleans the road every day.": "audio/cau/e156ac2a11c8608f.mp3", "Close your lips, then open them to say /b/.": "audio/cau/1c12f29d1557a6a6.mp3", "Please close the window; it's cold.": "audio/cau/20e2820b500dbcb2.mp3", "The shop is closed on Sunday.": "audio/cau/25be86170d7d0635.mp3", "Keep the door closed, please.": "audio/cau/31c537b90fc850d5.mp3", "Listen closely to the teacher.": "audio/cau/097906075ef96b43.mp3", "Look closely at the picture.": "audio/cau/991f23146cb2eaee.mp3", "Let's take a closer look at the words.": "audio/cau/3f25d4a7ecb1e46f.mp3", "Lan's house is close, but Mi's house is closer.": "audio/cau/95aeed65b79a000e.mp3", "We communicate with friends by email.": "audio/cau/71c0cac04361b2eb.mp3", "Good communication helps us communicate better.": "audio/cau/83b537bc6eb88878.mp3", "Communication is important in a team.": "audio/cau/ceae7194d8982d8f.mp3", "We communicate in English to improve our communication skills.": "audio/cau/78dbdceb83728ae8.mp3", "She is a communicative student.": "audio/cau/c7fbc92e73c9d5a0.mp3", "Be communicative with your classmates.": "audio/cau/dde8f897fd3f06c4.mp3", "She works for a computer company.": "audio/cau/dbaa7b1a7f381505.mp3", "His company is now a big business.": "audio/cau/8c1460aeda0ca27f.mp3", "Connect the laptop to the Internet.": "audio/cau/083f71db481310ee.mp3", "The bridge connects two villages.": "audio/cau/b1569f595ecaee4e.mp3", "Listen to the conversation and answer.": "audio/cau/9f48e7934c974946.mp3", "Mi had a short chat, not a long conversation.": "audio/cau/e32ab06f1cea65e6.mp3", "We converse in English in class.": "audio/cau/53bd8ab15aee8ea4.mp3", "They conversed for hours.": "audio/cau/0ca95dc23e5e741b.mp3", "Choose the correct answer A, B or C.": "audio/cau/6f45c31e9ee537be.mp3", "Nam's answer is correct, but mine is wrong.": "audio/cau/2f88ef38a2385ee5.mp3", "The teacher made corrections in red.": "audio/cau/895634813fdf81d2.mp3", "Check your corrections carefully.": "audio/cau/c829f7ab4f978d5b.mp3", "Try to say these new words correctly.": "audio/cau/d4da04af4337ec0f.mp3", "Her answer is correct because she read the question correctly.": "audio/cau/cee1de65a2a9d88f.mp3", "Viet Nam is a beautiful country.": "audio/cau/df0215608f1e8de4.mp3", "My grandparents live in the countryside of our country.": "audio/cau/00375e3b63fb00b1.mp3", "Life in the countryside is peaceful.": "audio/cau/95479ebba178019f.mp3", "The city is noisy, but the countryside is quiet.": "audio/cau/37f198fe8e1a722b.mp3", "A big crowd watched the fireworks.": "audio/cau/180db19310ac7bfe.mp3", "I don't like crowds.": "audio/cau/2eb825d78b2f77e4.mp3", "The market is very crowded at weekends.": "audio/cau/5f5083d37f44058f.mp3", "There was a big crowd, so the bus was crowded.": "audio/cau/75a57d4b9263cc0e.mp3", "Look at picture d and answer the question.": "audio/cau/cd1db823a64876e3.mp3", "Choose answer d, then write it in your notebook.": "audio/cau/d8924058670ef40e.mp3", "Can you describe your house?": "audio/cau/a0d5ad73f19e51bc.mp3", "Describe your friend and read your description to the class.": "audio/cau/5e8b000dcde9e11f.mp3", "We are describing people's appearance.": "audio/cau/6bc282b943512d78.mp3", "Lan is good at describing, and her description is lively.": "audio/cau/1a8ee4d3d58fbfa0.mp3", "Write a short description of your friend.": "audio/cau/1d3f9d3cf060662c.mp3", "Phong describes his school, and his description is funny.": "audio/cau/9801d95651b1cda6.mp3", "Write a descriptive paragraph about your room.": "audio/cau/053c0911268b28bb.mp3", "Use descriptive words like 'tall' and 'kind'.": "audio/cau/05df1ce0b4bb46d0.mp3", "I did my homework last night.": "audio/cau/52c1dc6ad84a16a5.mp3", "Did you do the project? Yes, I did.": "audio/cau/ce2a17ba3a5d2ade.mp3", "There is dirt on your shoes.": "audio/cau/d360a0d04782b35c.mp3", "The dirt from the building site makes the street dirty.": "audio/cau/43a785de1e1d3309.mp3", "The air in big cities is dirty.": "audio/cau/286767588a10e6b5.mp3", "Wash your dirty hands to remove the dirt.": "audio/cau/400fb6184b406956.mp3", "I dislike noisy and crowded places.": "audio/cau/5ace2bb2616bf75c.mp3", "Mi likes cats, but she dislikes dogs.": "audio/cau/a21ccd81f7c8d400.mp3", "I do my homework after dinner.": "audio/cau/dfa2558950305f83.mp3", "Phong did his homework, and now it is done.": "audio/cau/4e496982963ec9df.mp3", "Does Lan like ice cream?": "audio/cau/15298c934c7dedf6.mp3", "Nam does his homework, but he doesn't watch TV.": "audio/cau/16100881d98fba74.mp3", "Mi doesn't like milk very much.": "audio/cau/63a58b0dc618ef2d.mp3", "Nam does his homework, but Minh doesn't do it.": "audio/cau/362bb11ca0696388.mp3", "What are you doing now?": "audio/cau/cc6dbef7715013a7.mp3", "Lan is doing her homework, and she did the maths yesterday.": "audio/cau/c6619d790ec63e61.mp3", "I have done my homework.": "audio/cau/319d28fa8d112271.mp3", "Nam did the test well; he has done a great job.": "audio/cau/a6f61635ce93b0e4.mp3", "Please close the door when you leave.": "audio/cau/afff0ef664915359.mp3", "Our house has a big front door and a small gate.": "audio/cau/609f4be9be5f1a33.mp3", "Many people in Da Nang work downtown.": "audio/cau/937a590a251089b9.mp3", "Lan lives downtown, near the city centre market.": "audio/cau/ac4b9b9bb5e89502.mp3", "Lan's drawing is on the wall.": "audio/cau/e1c99913c9bb1dcf.mp3", "Minh draws well. He drew this drawing yesterday.": "audio/cau/a06a821e60587e14.mp3", "Life in the countryside can be dull for some teens.": "audio/cau/0347cee2d305ff73.mp3", "The film was dull, but the book was exciting.": "audio/cau/8b56307431aca227.mp3", "The dullness of the film made me sleepy.": "audio/cau/27793bb7a8a4dc46.mp3", "Games can break the dullness of a lesson.": "audio/cau/2b593816f2bca5fd.mp3", "There is a lot of dust on the road.": "audio/cau/c1f68cef800e46fb.mp3", "The dust makes the old room dusty.": "audio/cau/83383ea0e0ef9864.mp3", "Do exercise e on page ten.": "audio/cau/f397a6a2157f10ba.mp3", "The word 'eye' starts with the letter e.": "audio/cau/5f2132c30b4b4b2f.mp3", "I enjoy living in the city.": "audio/cau/1cc10e53aebeec12.mp3", "We enjoy the trip because it is very enjoyable.": "audio/cau/1a682a8a24ff63b3.mp3", "We had an enjoyable trip to Da Lat.": "audio/cau/fa0dde7e848371c0.mp3", "The English lesson was enjoyable.": "audio/cau/339769385e39a593.mp3", "Reading gives me a lot of enjoyment.": "audio/cau/baba1a4ac12d7cb6.mp3", "He plays the guitar for enjoyment.": "audio/cau/1ffb1fdae1d623a4.mp3", "Can you enlarge this photo?": "audio/cau/f7ea9d85d2ae68b7.mp3", "They plan to enlarge the school library.": "audio/cau/98d58917fdd12ccd.mp3", "Look at the example first.": "audio/cau/738e63739d26fe10.mp3", "Give an example; for example, cat is a noun.": "audio/cau/dc9ac2f421dfc6ef.mp3", "The news excited all the students.": "audio/cau/68587aef43ba8656.mp3", "Football games always excite my brother.": "audio/cau/00b8b1555e60de6d.mp3", "Lan is very excited about the school trip.": "audio/cau/4e01ac39890b7f7f.mp3", "Nam was excited when his friends visited his home.": "audio/cau/5f58aa62d7076582.mp3", "The children shouted with excitement.": "audio/cau/417b6a058ef4f6f8.mp3", "There is a lot of excitement before Tet.": "audio/cau/7418b1921ecb1163.mp3", "City life is exciting for teens.": "audio/cau/28945e456a70e4ca.mp3", "The trip was exciting, so we were very excited.": "audio/cau/53c60dbfd0e789cf.mp3", "Look at the audience and make eye contact.": "audio/cau/c4b16bbbce49770b.mp3", "Lan has big eyes and long black hair.": "audio/cau/15209ecb4d490c7b.mp3", "We had a fantastic holiday.": "audio/cau/f32cf4ee7488001e.mp3", "The view from the top is fantastic.": "audio/cau/e447250983ededde.mp3", "My school is not far from my house.": "audio/cau/fa693a015c0f0c90.mp3", "Phong's house is farther from school than mine.": "audio/cau/a8e4b376469602b6.mp3", "The park is farther from my house than the school.": "audio/cau/57440ac0cbf1421c.mp3", "Hoa lives far from school, but Lan lives farther.": "audio/cau/1cfcda03be6a4095.mp3", "What do you do in your free time?": "audio/cau/561d82e572a21e67.mp3", "I am busy today, but I am free tomorrow.": "audio/cau/ed0144aa5c166e1b.mp3", "Nothing is more precious than independence and freedom.": "audio/cau/c78680a19317fb70.mp3", "Teenagers want more freedom.": "audio/cau/e07eefd97e88854b.mp3", "Animals move freely in the national park.": "audio/cau/25e7ba19bac40728.mp3", "You can speak freely here.": "audio/cau/7323942bb0641fc5.mp3", "My new school is further from home.": "audio/cau/75bf280216804478.mp3", "Hoa walks far, but Minh walks further.": "audio/cau/2debf8693d0b2c6c.mp3", "The word 'garden' starts with the letter G.": "audio/cau/855344adad6266b6.mp3", "Please write a capital G on the board.": "audio/cau/090b2d929a80461a.mp3", "We play a game in our English class.": "audio/cau/f89d92956bddd8c5.mp3", "My brother is a gamer, and he loves this game.": "audio/cau/5869b678fdd00fcc.mp3", "My brother is a serious gamer.": "audio/cau/7a29eee205c35813.mp3", "Gamers should take breaks to rest their eyes.": "audio/cau/714192b94227026f.mp3", "Nam is good at maths.": "audio/cau/4fd3587c745c05a2.mp3", "Lan's English is good, but Mi's is better.": "audio/cau/d371c25a8502dc92.mp3", "My goodness! It's so hot today.": "audio/cau/262b2c15cb0e80ce.mp3", "She helped us out of goodness.": "audio/cau/68406886afe46623.mp3", "That's a great idea for our project!": "audio/cau/a54aafc7aa505f92.mp3", "We had a great time; the trip was wonderful.": "audio/cau/3dc3e9c44a5960ce.mp3", "Your help is greatly appreciated.": "audio/cau/3e7c4dbae7d688f3.mp3", "Technology has greatly changed our lives.": "audio/cau/718fe374663a2930.mp3", "We have a special guest at our party.": "audio/cau/05de5285bd976b2b.mp3", "The host welcomes each guest at the door.": "audio/cau/96d18dffb9235971.mp3", "We had a great time at the camp.": "audio/cau/9119cf6bce83ae88.mp3", "I have breakfast at six, but yesterday I had it late.": "audio/cau/8a0bd1bf7d672961.mp3", "The maths test was very hard.": "audio/cau/0fd61471858155e3.mp3", "Minh works hard; he is a hardworking student.": "audio/cau/32c549e4a9f6fc13.mp3", "Lan has two brothers.": "audio/cau/3ee04272e80b66c1.mp3", "Nam has a new bike; he had an old one before.": "audio/cau/756f69898700b7f4.mp3", "I hate waiting for the bus in the rain.": "audio/cau/3f99a8ce5b4ab56c.mp3", "Nam likes city life, but he hates traffic jams.": "audio/cau/6300158d6a0d3117.mp3", "We should not answer hatred with hatred.": "audio/cau/cb3de93e19e75388.mp3", "Hatred can hurt friendships.": "audio/cau/014fc79ff92a660d.mp3", "I have a cat and a dog.": "audio/cau/3942c510ddf250d4.mp3", "We have English today, and we had Maths yesterday.": "audio/cau/f53b658e1d0dc09e.mp3", "We are having lunch in the canteen.": "audio/cau/68be2432f9d1c150.mp3", "Lan is having fun because she has many friends here.": "audio/cau/955a8fc5bad8bd17.mp3", "My bedroom is here, next to the kitchen.": "audio/cau/38f5476965ee13ae.mp3", "Come here, Nam! Your bag is over there.": "audio/cau/1518838d605d3769.mp3", "Hoi An is a historic town.": "audio/cau/8866bea83dad139b.mp3", "We visited a historic building.": "audio/cau/1726fcbf4b6d8e27.mp3", "My hobby is collecting stamps.": "audio/cau/51f9ebccb029db6b.mp3", "Nam has many hobbies, and his main interest is music.": "audio/cau/f50e4d89304a6442.mp3", "We visited Hoi An during the summer holiday.": "audio/cau/578987a30e37dfd7.mp3", "Lan went on holiday to Da Lat last year.": "audio/cau/f422a8ac4b914b70.mp3", "I go home at five o'clock.": "audio/cau/a74ab800c921a80b.mp3", "After school, Mi does her homework at home.": "audio/cau/ecaf6456acc0b85d.mp3", "Nam does his homework at home every evening.": "audio/cau/0c529025b7e7c4aa.mp3", "The host asks three teenagers about their lives.": "audio/cau/e9176dc0794241d7.mp3", "The host welcomes each guest to the show.": "audio/cau/5487c29e3fefc14c.mp3", "Our house is near the river.": "audio/cau/462620c6e9d42610.mp3", "Lan's house is big, so the housework takes a long time.": "audio/cau/ffae3b516fc16794.mp3", "Lan helps her mother with the housework.": "audio/cau/603758dd29202743.mp3", "I do housework at weekends, like cleaning the house.": "audio/cau/603861c40de6e77e.mp3", "He was poor. However, he never gave up.": "audio/cau/893555bad2aff789.mp3", "It rained. However, Nam still went to school, but late.": "audio/cau/97115d20f691f7e4.mp3", "Correct the incorrect sentences.": "audio/cau/0fa204f88cc856c0.mp3", "Your answer is incorrect, so please correct it.": "audio/cau/2d6a22f249708653.mp3", "He spelled my name incorrectly.": "audio/cau/6f22f1fabc9ff68f.mp3", "If you answer incorrectly, try again.": "audio/cau/8a143b786c81fbef.mp3", "Chess is an indoor game.": "audio/cau/cadc57959ec34895.mp3", "Our school has an indoor swimming pool.": "audio/cau/83a64499cbb9212c.mp3", "It's raining. Let's play inside.": "audio/cau/a8fe3fe27e17a1ac.mp3", "Lan opens the door and goes inside.": "audio/cau/1c88017fec65bbcc.mp3", "Music is his greatest interest.": "audio/cau/01ea6b9ecb917ed3.mp3", "Minh has an interest in history, so he is interested in museums.": "audio/cau/218a4f41f5587ba6.mp3", "She was interested in science from an early age.": "audio/cau/34d48dff42b1323f.mp3", "Lan is interested in the book because it is interesting.": "audio/cau/916ab5cb0684d54c.mp3", "City life is interesting but stressful.": "audio/cau/d3da66e08dd099e1.mp3", "The film is interesting, and everyone is interested in it.": "audio/cau/4a91c463480dae58.mp3", "My school is big and beautiful.": "audio/cau/d5765e25cafa0eea.mp3", "Today it is sunny, but yesterday it was rainy.": "audio/cau/ed1bcaf6501bfd0c.mp3", "Nam isn't at home now.": "audio/cau/064ea182a69f9ba0.mp3", "This is my bag, but that one isn't.": "audio/cau/93f1c4d3918a4422.mp3", "The word 'kitchen' starts with the letter k.": "audio/cau/ac85fdd0f3c32f82.mp3", "Please write a capital K on the board.": "audio/cau/f5d61da2bd65aeef.mp3", "My teacher is very kind.": "audio/cau/a4408f8940b23d7a.mp3", "Hoa is kind to everyone, but her brother is sometimes unkind.": "audio/cau/92eef49a76085d2d.mp3", "The word 'lamp' starts with the letter l.": "audio/cau/c5e08a5413a4f66b.mp3", "Please write a capital L on the board.": "audio/cau/63173cda63a08912.mp3", "The One Pillar Pagoda is a famous landmark.": "audio/cau/9a4b95d099166bb7.mp3", "Big Ben is a landmark in London.": "audio/cau/066afa9be19cfb16.mp3", "We visited many landmarks in Ha Noi.": "audio/cau/5700c85734f18dfe.mp3", "Tell me about the landmarks in your city.": "audio/cau/b2dff840b1a176c5.mp3", "My house has a large garden.": "audio/cau/aca5eaaef305eea5.mp3", "Their house is large, and their garden is very big.": "audio/cau/58f11bb60767bcfb.mp3", "The town is largely quiet at night.": "audio/cau/6acff2f7d5971d4e.mp3", "Our success is largely due to teamwork.": "audio/cau/f39589c55d704f4b.mp3", "Ho Chi Minh City is larger than Da Nang.": "audio/cau/34248d77fe6d06a4.mp3", "Ha Noi is large, but Ho Chi Minh City is larger.": "audio/cau/8d6bb314d8a84f29.mp3", "Students need to sleep at least eight hours a day.": "audio/cau/06d7a5fd2aadd1a8.mp3", "Nam has less homework than Mi, and Lan has the least.": "audio/cau/144df5d8b5b5a253.mp3", "Village life is less noisy than city life.": "audio/cau/00a225b39b028bcc.mp3", "I have little time, less than Mi; Nam has the least.": "audio/cau/310826397361a2bd.mp3", "The Statue of Liberty is in New York.": "audio/cau/dcf663bf2913cbda.mp3", "Everyone wants liberty.": "audio/cau/e6611e8010ca6eec.mp3", "I like noodles very much.": "audio/cau/7557928354c11c4a.mp3", "I like cats, but I dislike spiders.": "audio/cau/bdd9c25c87fbc823.mp3", "Minh likes playing football.": "audio/cau/8b21f729dbeb8632.mp3", "Hoa likes music, but I like art.": "audio/cau/e9144dc6f8053afb.mp3", "Please listen to Lan's life story carefully.": "audio/cau/5e66ffcca03d62ba.mp3", "Minh is a good listener; he always listens to his friends.": "audio/cau/2a4b1d64993cd32a.mp3", "My mum is a good listener.": "audio/cau/c361fe2d103db23c.mp3", "The radio programme has many listeners.": "audio/cau/95723f87c574336f.mp3", "Thank you for listening.": "audio/cau/ee26d140bc752b99.mp3", "Nam is listening to music; he loves to listen to pop songs.": "audio/cau/8451afe66a0bd788.mp3", "My little brother is five years old.": "audio/cau/e22af4e6bb3d77f0.mp3", "I have a little money, but my sister has less.": "audio/cau/520fdc680c743ed9.mp3", "Ho Chi Minh City is very lively at night.": "audio/cau/f7f9de50246fc30a.mp3", "The market is lively and busy in the morning.": "audio/cau/be87297ba2d5a7fc.mp3", "Bat Trang pottery is a famous local product.": "audio/cau/ea08f150b9375ac4.mp3", "Many locals buy food from local farmers at the market.": "audio/cau/dfc3f008f3837ff1.mp3", "Look at the board, please.": "audio/cau/512572a71fea8cfe.mp3", "Look at Minh! He is very good-looking today.": "audio/cau/3a8f3a88e8a3813b.mp3", "Nam looked at the old photos of his village.": "audio/cau/57a1a25de6c14b73.mp3", "She looked tired yesterday, but today she looks happy.": "audio/cau/72e5fb4099eea871.mp3", "Mi is looking for her notebook in the bedroom.": "audio/cau/9cf0853b1a840504.mp3", "Look! Nam is looking at the picture on the wall.": "audio/cau/debf12a72a75e3eb.mp3", "Mi looks happy today.": "audio/cau/d53ae1b2afc27fcb.mp3", "Look at Nam; he looks tired.": "audio/cau/b6b16cdb7526bf98.mp3", "Mai has a lot of friends at school.": "audio/cau/5010f52a3a68ba0b.mp3", "Minh reads a lot, and he has lots of books.": "audio/cau/356256a0d64c06ca.mp3", "There are lots of books in our school library.": "audio/cau/3190c7d803a13870.mp3", "Phong has lots of friends and a lot of free time.": "audio/cau/4a66fae37e042e36.mp3", "Please don't be loud in the library.": "audio/cau/b4956ef2c49e1b40.mp3", "Nam has a loud voice, and he sings loudly.": "audio/cau/956ffd4ad9cd7167.mp3", "I love my family.": "audio/cau/02c5061798cc56cc.mp3", "My grandma is loving, and I love her a lot.": "audio/cau/588e4f5967e2076b.mp3", "What a lovely day!": "audio/cau/d4038241635895d6.mp3", "Her little sister is lovely.": "audio/cau/2566ff2d6fc065b2.mp3", "My mother is a loving person.": "audio/cau/5a0aadfbccb5dec1.mp3", "Hoa has a loving family, and she loves them a lot.": "audio/cau/dbfb0082905aad2d.mp3", "Good luck with your test!": "audio/cau/c0a410312292362e.mp3", "Red envelopes bring luck at Tet.": "audio/cau/615dd5919e8bdda6.mp3", "Luckily, it didn't rain on our picnic.": "audio/cau/6982f4a9e956befa.mp3", "Luckily, I found my lost key.": "audio/cau/da4487ddd1deb0f9.mp3", "You are lucky to have kind friends.": "audio/cau/1a666c0109b4ac0c.mp3", "Nam was lucky, but Phong was unlucky in the game.": "audio/cau/32cb15ff61c73704.mp3", "I'm a student at Nguyen Du High School.": "audio/cau/fc4e40becc452649.mp3", "I'm happy because I am with my best friends.": "audio/cau/70dc61c954d001ef.mp3", "Match the words with the pictures.": "audio/cau/c554f0656d3ab896.mp3", "Match the names with the photos and connect them with lines.": "audio/cau/b9cb7dc9f6dfba6f.mp3", "Read the model story first.": "audio/cau/96d5d11b4bc02327.mp3", "My father is my role model.": "audio/cau/d6cd0d28b863f1d8.mp3", "My shoes are covered in mud.": "audio/cau/b5c2cbc85f9f6566.mp3", "Buffaloes love lying in the mud.": "audio/cau/c23927ae9fbfcf52.mp3", "In 'running', we double the letter n.": "audio/cau/f2d3227ba2e63feb.mp3", "Run ends in n, so we write running with two n's.": "audio/cau/840a0ecac7ac2b05.mp3", "What is your full name?": "audio/cau/3560e14e0864aa5c.mp3", "Name two products Jobs introduced after 1997.": "audio/cau/2fa79a695478cb53.mp3", "We learn the names of rooms.": "audio/cau/b9a33c9a4dcc29b3.mp3", "Write your names on the paper.": "audio/cau/22570cab59b4d849.mp3", "Viet Nam is a nation of 54 ethnic groups.": "audio/cau/fc0377b6b344369a.mp3", "The whole nation celebrates Tet.": "audio/cau/bde6381a94c2d89f.mp3", "The school is nearer to my house than the market.": "audio/cau/5ab3eb0827d8a997.mp3", "The park is near, the bus stop is nearer, the shop is nearest.": "audio/cau/7a383b34e10fdcad.mp3", "Where is the nearest bus stop?": "audio/cau/8fb9d4602deb0ebd.mp3", "The nearest market is near the post office.": "audio/cau/8c3390260d6f3961.mp3", "It was raining. Nevertheless, we went out.": "audio/cau/96e041b73011f4c0.mp3", "The test was hard. Nevertheless, I passed.": "audio/cau/f2dd49917bd958c6.mp3", "He started a new life in Ha Noi.": "audio/cau/c5e37434302d9841.mp3", "This bike is new, but that one is old.": "audio/cau/dae26bf3d19dc70a.mp3", "My phone is newer than yours.": "audio/cau/b9582550ab411283.mp3", "This building is newer.": "audio/cau/94018b78e01f455f.mp3", "We live in a newly built house.": "audio/cau/966f2a75601347b9.mp3", "The park was newly opened.": "audio/cau/3a8e3879e38476c9.mp3", "I watch the news on TV every evening.": "audio/cau/4eec6079f4f4c6a3.mp3", "The news is good: a new park is open.": "audio/cau/c4024e28c9bf5003.mp3", "Nice to meet you, Mai.": "audio/cau/7c4c4da145e9a59d.mp3", "Lan is nice, and she always speaks nicely.": "audio/cau/b93deacf2eeac62d.mp3", "Please ask nicely.": "audio/cau/44ab037cea553fcf.mp3", "The room is nicely decorated.": "audio/cau/6eb8998173f66908.mp3", "Our street is noisy because of the traffic.": "audio/cau/c625fc467757080e.mp3", "The city is noisy, but my village is quiet.": "audio/cau/63c66e344ab53850.mp3", "She did not give up her dream.": "audio/cau/b5d39e3052bc5fbb.mp3", "I am not tired, and I'm not hungry.": "audio/cau/9485504d93b05a38.mp3", "Did you notice her new haircut?": "audio/cau/f0ec69a680ab4edb.mp3", "Read the notice on the board.": "audio/cau/decda91337e8460e.mp3", "What is your phone number?": "audio/cau/bb5a84e5f55e9ae8.mp3", "Seven is my favourite number of all the numbers.": "audio/cau/d25e38b724724a81.mp3", "Let's count the numbers from one to ten.": "audio/cau/edc8b3b439007443.mp3", "Mi writes the numbers, and Nam reads each number.": "audio/cau/c24522f3e518abbf.mp3", "Turn off the lights when you leave.": "audio/cau/3a68f3ab6e248006.mp3", "Turn on the fan, but turn off the TV.": "audio/cau/bdd957c99adde5f0.mp3", "My grandfather is seventy years old.": "audio/cau/ad4ec0973ce447a3.mp3", "My bike is old, but my sister's bike is new.": "audio/cau/dc292ece9d402a3f.mp3", "My brother is older than me.": "audio/cau/5670535468e3c19f.mp3", "This house is old, but that house is older.": "audio/cau/854d4f823994b96e.mp3", "This is the oldest pagoda in Ha Noi.": "audio/cau/112d241056ccf384.mp3", "My grandpa is the oldest in my family.": "audio/cau/9f9847641a26a88e.mp3", "Please open your books to page twenty.": "audio/cau/53593951c79684b4.mp3", "Open the window, but close the door.": "audio/cau/7aa87d369a509fca.mp3", "Where is the bottle opener?": "audio/cau/dba02936e0725420.mp3", "I need a can opener.": "audio/cau/adb4ffcc3719f644.mp3", "The opening of your talk should be interesting.": "audio/cau/7a05b586b50872dd.mp3", "The library will open today; come to the opening at 9 a.m.": "audio/cau/ba81136abf0a6d5d.mp3", "The Ha Noi Opera House is very beautiful.": "audio/cau/eda6ae5e43f2d1ba.mp3", "We watched an opera at the Opera House.": "audio/cau/2be5289d7ca98945.mp3", "Mi went out with her friends last night.": "audio/cau/6662db3eac9ce4e0.mp3", "Nam wants to find out more about his grandfather's life.": "audio/cau/c2c4b3120ecb6468.mp3", "The city has many outdoor markets.": "audio/cau/70f031e665dcb6a3.mp3", "Phong likes outdoor sports, so he often plays outdoors.": "audio/cau/62d7cb3e1f835b37.mp3", "My friends and I like playing outdoors.": "audio/cau/b93328230ef90e2f.mp3", "It's sunny today, so let's eat our lunch outdoors.": "audio/cau/5f24f91daf666c75.mp3", "The buses are overcrowded in the morning.": "audio/cau/de157660ffd726b8.mp3", "Big cities are often overcrowded.": "audio/cau/176b08e6e268bb05.mp3", "The film starts at 8 p.m.": "audio/cau/5b3d11f7cb5bec98.mp3", "School finishes at 4.30 p.m., and I have dinner at 7 p.m.": "audio/cau/6193e0ae396e4d78.mp3", "The workers pack the silk scarves into boxes.": "audio/cau/fb20eff00e9edb32.mp3", "Mi packs her bag, and her mum unpacks it after the trip.": "audio/cau/328c5412cf5f0d19.mp3", "I got a package from my aunt.": "audio/cau/3f50f697aa87ddc5.mp3", "The package arrived this morning.": "audio/cau/52e8828546756676.mp3", "The bus was packed with students this morning.": "audio/cau/61e071dde6dcfc00.mp3", "The market is packed at the weekend but empty at night.": "audio/cau/19507b738fe0d95c.mp3", "Can you buy a packet of biscuits?": "audio/cau/fc453a061fd399a9.mp3", "I ate a packet of crisps.": "audio/cau/6845379bcbb052c0.mp3", "We visited Tran Quoc Pagoda.": "audio/cau/ffea782bbea7c15a.mp3", "There is an old pagoda in my village.": "audio/cau/8644c5a2ff229b58.mp3", "Fishing is my grandpa's favourite pastime.": "audio/cau/e29fedf95eda4573.mp3", "Reading is a good pastime.": "audio/cau/19774eb6612d0fdd.mp3", "The village is quiet and peaceful, not noisy like the city.": "audio/cau/c7f81daa39689185.mp3", "Can you take a photo of us?": "audio/cau/4e7337681afc841a.mp3", "This photo is a nice picture of my class.": "audio/cau/94f608c9dc656d2b.mp3", "This is a photograph of my family.": "audio/cau/be34afde07857706.mp3", "She took a photograph of the sea.": "audio/cau/0deaad3e91e725aa.mp3", "My uncle is a photographer.": "audio/cau/84945e0c05f98e38.mp3", "The photographer took many pictures.": "audio/cau/78c35f6d244bab0b.mp3", "Photography is my hobby.": "audio/cau/88fd201b0df30c9f.mp3", "She joined a photography club.": "audio/cau/2a930abea3fb3545.mp3", "Look at the photos of my friends.": "audio/cau/8a988a56d17dddc5.mp3", "Mi takes a photo, and Lan takes many photos.": "audio/cau/df1811e9acc25b9a.mp3", "Look at the picture and describe the man.": "audio/cau/b1d73989f1f7619c.mp3", "Hoa draws a picture, and Nam takes a photo of it.": "audio/cau/40c2b9c3207a7713.mp3", "Mi draws beautiful pictures in art class.": "audio/cau/1037e2e30ff7fb85.mp3", "We took many photos and put the pictures on the wall.": "audio/cau/5ddc63bf192b9304.mp3", "The temple has many stone pillars.": "audio/cau/97de74904a75965e.mp3", "The pillar is painted red.": "audio/cau/93c3251c58b539fb.mp3", "This is a nice place to live.": "audio/cau/160e9180eaed0aee.mp3", "Let's meet at the usual place after school.": "audio/cau/f760c0b8e65d51b8.mp3", "There are many interesting places in my town.": "audio/cau/22530fda716b27a9.mp3", "The market is my favourite place in town.": "audio/cau/6904ef4273568097.mp3", "Factories pollute the river.": "audio/cau/2157f7ac9f788df5.mp3", "Don't pollute the beach.": "audio/cau/13ed1940cd163a96.mp3", "The air in big cities is often polluted.": "audio/cau/3f2265c1134300cf.mp3", "Traffic causes air pollution, so the city is polluted.": "audio/cau/41cbf08c31632fed.mp3", "Noise pollution is a big problem in the city.": "audio/cau/6f7de550e9658c27.mp3", "Factories pollute the river, so the water is polluted.": "audio/cau/b4e816708b260a17.mp3", "This dress is prettier than that one.": "audio/cau/63fe1b4c4f4eedca.mp3", "The garden looks prettier in spring.": "audio/cau/15e4f1fdd660cb5f.mp3", "She has a pretty face.": "audio/cau/b4057ea8bc4143dd.mp3", "The test was pretty easy.": "audio/cau/c3222808c2b9263e.mp3", "The library is a quiet place.": "audio/cau/cf5d391e8e881e58.mp3", "My village is quieter and more peaceful than the city.": "audio/cau/fe9afae0f73f7b97.mp3", "Please speak quietly in the library.": "audio/cau/d3d8ecfcd2451005.mp3", "She closed the door quietly.": "audio/cau/ca20754f99efde5b.mp3", "I love the quietness of the countryside.": "audio/cau/13091db4624edf0a.mp3", "The quietness helped me study.": "audio/cau/b9d1231d026f5544.mp3", "The word 'red' starts with the letter r.": "audio/cau/19d12f34975f740f.mp3", "'Rabbit' and 'room' both begin with R.": "audio/cau/aca28cd4f322eeb4.mp3", "The rain helps the plants grow.": "audio/cau/dcb6145c778bef36.mp3", "It is rainy today, so take an umbrella.": "audio/cau/10a2647a630c9236.mp3", "The area has heavy rainfall in summer.": "audio/cau/db56feb620e08e0a.mp3", "Rainfall is low in the desert.": "audio/cau/6d52d9afa01f4839.mp3", "It often rains in the afternoon in summer.": "audio/cau/8ec8e4cd50e1baf5.mp3", "It often rains in Hue in October.": "audio/cau/17f31669b2380e74.mp3", "It's a rainy day today.": "audio/cau/7487252f9ed5b9ee.mp3", "The rainy season starts in May.": "audio/cau/041cbb54abf51c95.mp3", "I read a book before bed every night.": "audio/cau/52f4120305948c56.mp3", "Yesterday Mi read a story, because reading is her hobby.": "audio/cau/a206c7fecbd29a47.mp3", "My sister is a fast reader.": "audio/cau/c997b3414e90f2e3.mp3", "Lan is a good reader because she reads every day.": "audio/cau/804882ef0e352a60.mp3", "Reading helps us learn new words.": "audio/cau/a36b0142402545f6.mp3", "I read a story last night, and it was great.": "audio/cau/67941e0da7d7be3c.mp3", "I relax by reading books at weekends.": "audio/cau/7a14312dbb4ab728.mp3", "After school, I listen to music to relax.": "audio/cau/cb3ed8bfdce9e8f8.mp3", "If you don't feel well, you can stay at home and rest.": "audio/cau/80c50d7bcdc0aa2e.mp3", "Hoa rests for ten minutes after running.": "audio/cau/0e4d9ca9b895f037.mp3", "We had a restful weekend.": "audio/cau/5b74bff45779c503.mp3", "The garden is very restful.": "audio/cau/3998112657f9d2d2.mp3", "Your answer is right, Nam.": "audio/cau/de0207c9ebd60141.mp3", "Is this answer right or wrong?": "audio/cau/6f5632fc348cdcbc.mp3", "She rightly said no.": "audio/cau/0716d99ea752c0a9.mp3", "He was rightly proud of his work.": "audio/cau/82f83dc7701970f6.mp3", "My aunt's house is near the river.": "audio/cau/a6e8ddca094f143a.mp3", "We swim in the river in summer.": "audio/cau/ad856ac1e2451519.mp3", "We had a picnic by the riverside.": "audio/cau/7c9b83750b247a1b.mp3", "There is a riverside café.": "audio/cau/2fc65f9804bd39f5.mp3", "She's my best friend in class 6A.": "audio/cau/810592fcf73e04e7.mp3", "This is Vinh's bike, and he's in my class.": "audio/cau/6a8b8131a5222edf.mp3", "Read the sample answer before you write.": "audio/cau/ea7645ef6a324d03.mp3", "This sample is a good example of a life story.": "audio/cau/c91d20f5c55e871f.mp3", "I saw a beautiful rainbow yesterday afternoon.": "audio/cau/87d8e8a9aa1c8cb1.mp3", "We saw many animals at the zoo.": "audio/cau/bf15ca1e43e22b9a.mp3", "Can you see the picture on page ten?": "audio/cau/505d4b7b963a3756.mp3", "I saw Lan yesterday, and I'll see her tomorrow.": "audio/cau/d14cce6b0cd0e6db.mp3", "You seem very tired today, Nam.": "audio/cau/35d0d317c3b0474d.mp3", "The test seems easy, but be careful.": "audio/cau/464d526b15ed996d.mp3", "Have you seen the new market in town?": "audio/cau/0689eb245aec2ebc.mp3", "Yes, I have seen it; I saw it last week.": "audio/cau/476814d0d69a0131.mp3", "Please shut the door behind you.": "audio/cau/e6715fb5ffbc0de9.mp3", "The shop shuts at nine o'clock.": "audio/cau/46d348eb4a2e1b29.mp3", "There are trees on both sides of the road.": "audio/cau/f143b07fb9a6df16.mp3", "A square has four sides.": "audio/cau/ab9f343508c0a756.mp3", "My grandpa has poor sight.": "audio/cau/5906c0adbcad9b65.mp3", "The sunset over the sea is a beautiful sight.": "audio/cau/39836f836f67a5ef.mp3", "My house is small but cosy.": "audio/cau/361843b6d8177bed.mp3", "I live in a small flat, not a big house.": "audio/cau/e341afdae498f225.mp3", "My village is smaller than the city.": "audio/cau/77ad0931648736fe.mp3", "This shop is small, but that one is even smaller.": "audio/cau/0d67ec98fa2886f3.mp3", "This is the smallest room in the house.": "audio/cau/be5f404374212531.mp3", "Vatican City is the smallest country in the world.": "audio/cau/df407ba4f28abf48.mp3", "Can you speak English well?": "audio/cau/7e70c8ed41dd5f73.mp3", "Mi spoke to her teacher after class.": "audio/cau/9631c4f9d08103cf.mp3", "She is a good English speaker.": "audio/cau/ad8983e10a3153eb.mp3", "Turn up the speaker, please.": "audio/cau/176c25890d4baf0b.mp3", "Our head teacher gave a short speech today.": "audio/cau/d7f9999a0661fac2.mp3", "Mi will speak first, then Nam will give his speech.": "audio/cau/e7405c38166acf2a.mp3", "She spoke English very well.": "audio/cau/021d27ba9b445e58.mp3", "I spoke to my teacher after class.": "audio/cau/8a7ed13ad52bfd30.mp3", "Many people visit Ba Dinh Square every day.": "audio/cau/5a4604b4b01fd078.mp3", "The square in our town has a big old tree.": "audio/cau/ecba6f9e46e4d0a0.mp3", "There is a statue of Uncle Ho in the park.": "audio/cau/602c12aec91393c4.mp3", "Many families move to the suburbs for more space.": "audio/cau/d55d207df96c9b07.mp3", "My school is in the city centre, but I live in the suburbs.": "audio/cau/a6150b961a8dbd3b.mp3", "Nguyen is a common surname in Viet Nam.": "audio/cau/c8102c73dadc352c.mp3", "What is your surname?": "audio/cau/67eafe2d8243a1d5.mp3", "In \"don't\", the letter t comes from not.": "audio/cau/549e7bc5a2456c75.mp3", "I didn't go out because I was tired.": "audio/cau/5cc7479c1b749e64.mp3", "I often talk to my grandma on the phone.": "audio/cau/30262ea1745db608.mp3", "Lan is talkative; she loves to talk and chat with friends.": "audio/cau/ef14453a567466fc.mp3", "My little sister is very talkative.": "audio/cau/abe6afbd7c67a621.mp3", "He is shy, not talkative.": "audio/cau/c9c299a5fd04a0e9.mp3", "The traffic in the city is terrible today.": "audio/cau/01ea841928344884.mp3", "The food was terrible, but the view was wonderful.": "audio/cau/93b659e2b5f66a2e.mp3", "There is a big garden in my house.": "audio/cau/94db3c106fafa1ac.mp3", "Your bag is here, and my bag is over there.": "audio/cau/37204e4c7e951d02.mp3", "Thirdly, we should save water.": "audio/cau/a368bc621a56c1a0.mp3", "Thirdly, exercise keeps you healthy.": "audio/cau/5e62888bdcf24d9a.mp3", "I was thrilled to win the prize.": "audio/cau/bdb358259efea1f4.mp3", "The children were thrilled with their gifts.": "audio/cau/448715896fc5f54f.mp3", "It was a thrilling football match.": "audio/cau/116ede8489033537.mp3", "We watched a thrilling film last night.": "audio/cau/f5abe0ab3d608764.mp3", "What time is it now, Mum?": "audio/cau/1cbca6b4e0afa66c.mp3", "Look at the timetable; it is time for maths.": "audio/cau/9b6fb48058293171.mp3", "I go swimming three times a week.": "audio/cau/512450e05866c9fd.mp3", "The school gate is busy at drop-off and pick-up times.": "audio/cau/f6bdb2679cb129f8.mp3", "Let's look at our new timetable.": "audio/cau/b37160eda36c9395.mp3", "We have Maths on Monday according to the timetable.": "audio/cau/46e65b162f79e5db.mp3", "We went on a tour of Ha Noi.": "audio/cau/b1aef3993b1d87cd.mp3", "The bus tour starts at 8 a.m.": "audio/cau/dd11943cd2068c0b.mp3", "Tourism is important to Da Nang.": "audio/cau/66c18d8036dc4cca.mp3", "Eco-tourism helps protect nature.": "audio/cau/e2cac58b1dc37552.mp3", "A tourist asked me the way to the lake.": "audio/cau/85504a3dd570c415.mp3", "Tourism is important, and every tourist loves our pho.": "audio/cau/28ec58cef47dd36f.mp3", "Many tourists visit Hoi An every year.": "audio/cau/34e133dcd9a0fdd4.mp3", "The market attracts tourists and locals.": "audio/cau/4d4408900393fd12.mp3", "The Eiffel Tower is in Paris.": "audio/cau/fe37d9fe97785fd5.mp3", "We climbed to the top of the tower.": "audio/cau/433f0380d8e01edf.mp3", "I live in a small town near the sea.": "audio/cau/d1834f8b57570cad.mp3", "My town is bigger than my grandparents' village.": "audio/cau/5dce2eb178b20c1e.mp3", "The more rubbish there is, the uglier the city becomes.": "audio/cau/40b42b7b9a1766fc.mp3", "This old building is ugly, but that one is even uglier.": "audio/cau/88d3dbf1154e8f0f.mp3", "The ugliness of the rubbish shocked us.": "audio/cau/1d39b5ddc3d3e0e3.mp3", "Beauty and ugliness are in the eye of the viewer.": "audio/cau/7b7da2fd6065d419.mp3", "The street looks ugly with all that rubbish.": "audio/cau/84027adc63b4f048.mp3", "The park was ugly before, but now it is beautiful.": "audio/cau/133c40c5a01388aa.mp3", "He is uninterested in sports.": "audio/cau/c861b97da9e2e85f.mp3", "The students looked uninterested.": "audio/cau/26cb7f657950d3cc.mp3", "The film was long and uninteresting.": "audio/cau/fe255bc43d0bc7d1.mp3", "Nothing is uninteresting if you look closely.": "audio/cau/fbd9a81d434e40b7.mp3", "It's unkind to laugh at others.": "audio/cau/192d5bf86ba98a81.mp3", "She said some unkind words.": "audio/cau/47391550bf40693a.mp3", "We were unlucky to lose the match.": "audio/cau/50408307171ff37c.mp3", "Some people think 13 is an unlucky number.": "audio/cau/641f94f146054f14.mp3", "We unpacked our bags at the hotel.": "audio/cau/b59a00090f4aa13b.mp3", "Please unpack the shopping.": "audio/cau/120d42b483001238.mp3", "How about + V-ing? How about going to the park?": "audio/cau/4bd32e061c4f1188.mp3", "In the formula, V means a verb, like 'go' or 'play'.": "audio/cau/2a5961c55ebdeb37.mp3", "'Play' is a verb, but 'happy' is not.": "audio/cau/7cb0163f6a27d0af.mp3", "Underline the verb in each sentence.": "audio/cau/c45fa8ec83b8ba93.mp3", "Write the -ing form of these verbs.": "audio/cau/9a8d4d3f46f1577e.mp3", "'Run' and 'swim' are verbs; can you find one more verb?": "audio/cau/1cd8c87f9c695ab7.mp3", "My school is very big and beautiful.": "audio/cau/5cd4ea7091dbf666.mp3", "Thank you very much for your help.": "audio/cau/162955bdaf4118ee.mp3", "My grandparents live in a small village.": "audio/cau/959ff3761670ea0d.mp3", "The villagers in our village grow rice.": "audio/cau/c5c92b3fc554d83c.mp3", "The villagers are very friendly.": "audio/cau/83b65e1cf54c314b.mp3", "A villager showed us the way.": "audio/cau/8c99ee2c847588ae.mp3", "There are many craft villages near Ha Noi.": "audio/cau/9064f8b48096eb71.mp3", "Bat Trang is a famous pottery village.": "audio/cau/7212e9943aa25d4c.mp3", "Visit our website for more information.": "audio/cau/ac9737600d9243d7.mp3", "Phong visited his grandparents, and they enjoyed his visit.": "audio/cau/24f2a12ad9734414.mp3", "Each visitor gets a free map.": "audio/cau/d13c12d782a36fe7.mp3", "Many visitors visit Hoi An every year.": "audio/cau/f97ffc3669fff0e8.mp3", "Bat Trang attracts many visitors.": "audio/cau/3b53ccd4a057d15e.mp3", "Visitors visit the craft village to buy pottery.": "audio/cau/364cd950cea318c5.mp3", "Nam was at home yesterday.": "audio/cau/faca1649a4ef8a76.mp3", "I was tired, but my friends were happy.": "audio/cau/e3e7c2c50296c48e.mp3", "We watch TV after dinner.": "audio/cau/8b47f4f4b321b7f8.mp3", "Nam is watching a film; his new watch is on the table.": "audio/cau/850cc4ddfbc726bf.mp3", "Trang watches films at the cinema at weekends.": "audio/cau/58771fac6bb56dc4.mp3", "My brother likes to watch football, and he watches it every Sunday.": "audio/cau/b5419c83106d199e.mp3", "What's the weather like today?": "audio/cau/967d9c636aaa6e59.mp3", "The weather is sunny and warm.": "audio/cau/8fdced42cdce5802.mp3", "Lan sings very well.": "audio/cau/8d831f0b90fa91ed.mp3", "Nam plays football well, but Phong plays better.": "audio/cau/7c13b2c077241009.mp3", "They were in Ha Noi last year.": "audio/cau/a884324b521a97cd.mp3", "I was at school, and my parents were at work.": "audio/cau/d6c97d0e9f2b3c05.mp3", "We had a wonderful holiday.": "audio/cau/b731d7b223c248dd.mp3", "What a wonderful idea!": "audio/cau/83d5b6cb831dd9a7.mp3", "My parents work in a hospital in Ha Noi.": "audio/cau/4a34bda1f13dc400.mp3", "My uncle is a hard-working worker; he works every day.": "audio/cau/4fe31bc354d9e0c5.mp3", "The worker wears a helmet.": "audio/cau/9c235c7e97cd46ce.mp3", "Factory workers work long hours.": "audio/cau/dd3d0d4cd13eb0b4.mp3", "My mum is working in the garden now.": "audio/cau/0fc0a939dbaf61f1.mp3", "Dad works hard, and today he is working late.": "audio/cau/8fff1884b3def435.mp3", "Please write your name here.": "audio/cau/a728b2e865ff5c76.mp3", "Mi likes to write, and she wrote a story yesterday.": "audio/cau/a907f42938059961.mp3", "My aunt is a writer.": "audio/cau/0b898dc7eb5824c9.mp3", "Mi wants to be a writer because she loves to write stories.": "audio/cau/5ce118b1d0da266b.mp3", "She was writing a book when I phoned her.": "audio/cau/97a3ce971a3a7562.mp3", "Mi is writing a letter, and she wrote one yesterday too.": "audio/cau/f5189e5fac049044.mp3", "Lan's answer was wrong, so she tried again.": "audio/cau/1b25a01594f7e8c8.mp3", "You look sad, Minh. What's wrong?": "audio/cau/bde31146d26c8a31.mp3", "He spelled my name wrongly.": "audio/cau/6f375b9c1ad0fc97.mp3", "She was wrongly blamed for the mistake.": "audio/cau/5c429e62a8f6c2c9.mp3", "Lie becomes lying: change 'ie' to y and add -ing.": "audio/cau/ccd0d01ed2295121.mp3", "The word 'yellow' begins with the letter y.": "audio/cau/413244207833f8bd.mp3", "My uncle is young and active.": "audio/cau/25ab8c1b23e804a5.mp3", "Nam is younger than Minh, but they are both young.": "audio/cau/ae83efbb6b4f31bc.mp3", "My younger brother is eight years old.": "audio/cau/4f32791e715fc8a4.mp3", "Lan is young, and her sister is even younger.": "audio/cau/a298d4fd339450fa.mp3", "My grandpa often talks about his youth.": "audio/cau/2cc4847b1b21067b.mp3", "The youth club meets on Saturdays.": "audio/cau/b613598b5b961ed0.mp3"};
